/E (Prepare in Unreal Engine 5 \(UE5\): The filmmaker first embeds "Scene Locators" \(digital null objects,prefixed with sceneloc_\) into the UE5 scene. The scene's geometry, along with these locators, is then exported from Unreal as a standard USD file.)
