/E (Package with Autoshot: The USD file is subsequently loaded into the Autoshot application. Since high- resolution textures \(4K or 8K\) would overwhelm a mobile device, Autoshot offers an automated downsampling utility. The user selects the USD file, chooses to downsample the textures \(e.g., to 512x512\), and clicks Make USDZ.)
