/E (Finalizing the USDZ: Autoshot processes the top-level USD file, aggregates all linked dependencies and the compressed textures, archives them using a standard protocol \(zips them\), and renames the output with a .usdz extension. This compact file is then pushed directly to the Jetset application.)
