/T (While Beeble Studio's AI rotoscoping typically yields excellent results when fed high-resolution footage from professional cinema cameras, it can occasionally struggle to produce perfect mattes when utilizing standard 1920x1080 HD footage natively captured by an iPhone. If the automated Beeble roto is unsatisfactory,  filmmakers can implement a totally optional, manual alpha mask workflow.)
/E (While Beeble Studio's AI rotoscoping typically yields excellent results when fed high-resolution footage from professional cinema cameras, it can occasionally struggle to produce perfect mattes when utilizing standard 1920x1080 HD footage natively captured by an iPhone. If the automated Beeble roto is unsatisfactory,  filmmakers can implement a totally optional, manual alpha mask workflow.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [5]
>>
