/E (While this specific pipeline successfully democratizes high-end VFX capabilities, the reliance on mobile AR tracking and AI-inferred materials introduces highly specific technical trade-offs. The two most prominent and heavily documented issues that practitioners must navigate are AI-induced footage clipping artifacts and the deeply complex behavior of shadows associated with UE5 media plates.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [5]
>>
