/P 108 0 R
/T (A key component of this workflow is the use of Autoshot, which simplifies camera solving and USDZ data synchronization between physical and digital environments. By automating complex processes such as camera alignment and spatial calibration, Autoshot ensures that real-world camera movement translates seamlessly into the virtual scene. This not only improves efficiency but also enhances accuracy, enabling filmmakers to focus more on creative decisions rather than technical troubleshooting.)
/E (A key component of this workflow is the use of Autoshot, which simplifies camera solving and USDZ data synchronization between physical and digital environments. By automating complex processes such as camera alignment and spatial calibration, Autoshot ensures that real-world camera movement translates seamlessly into the virtual scene. This not only improves efficiency but also enhances accuracy, enabling filmmakers to focus more on creative decisions rather than technical troubleshooting.)
/Pg 27 0 R
