/Title (Ultimately, the project positions virtual production as an accessible solution for modern filmmaking. By combining real-time engines with AI tools, creators gain greater control over storytelling, experiment with complex environments, and achieve cinematic-quality results with limited resources.)
/Dest [10 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 371 0 R
/Prev 1037 0 R
>>
endobj
