/Title (The culmination of this pipeline occurs back in Unreal Engine 5, where the default video plate is upgraded with the multi-channel assets. However, rather than utilizing the default Image Plate generated by Autoshot, this advanced pipeline relies heavily on the Composure projection system to achieve superior spatial integration and flawless shadow generation.)
