/Title (In Autoshot's Take Selection panel, the filmmaker first defines the precise In and Out points by scrubbing through the newly synchronized video files, isolating only the footage needed for the final edit. After this frame range is established, the user activates the "Solve" function. The integrated COLMAP solver then receives the specific video frames' optical flow data, along with the ARKit tracking information. This Structure-from-Motion \(SfM\) process mathematically refines the raw mobile data, resulting in a highly accurate 3D point cloud and a smooth, precise camera trajectory, free of jitter.)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1479 0 R
>>
endobj
